      "Antilineala lehen osagaian: <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">⟨</mo><mi>α</mi><mi>f</mi><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mi>g</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">⟩</mo><mi>ρ</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>α</mi><mo>*</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">⟨</mo><mi>f</mi><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mi>g</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">⟩</mo><mi>ρ</mi></msub></mrow></math>.",
      "Simetria hermitikoa: <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">⟨</mo><mi>f</mi><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mi>g</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">⟩</mo><mi>ρ</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">⟨</mo><mi>g</mi><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mi>f</mi><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">⟩</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo>*</mo></msubsup></mrow></math>.",
